&lt;p style="margin-left: 0px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="margin-left: 78px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left"&gt;(２）有形固定資産&lt;/p&gt;
